list.item:
Eisenhower, Major John
                                S. D., Assistant Staff Secretary to the President;
                        promoted to Lieutenant Colonel in May 1960

Herter, Christian
                                A., Under Secretary of State to April 1959;
                        thereafter Secretary of State

Kennedy, John
                                F., Democratic Senator from Massachusetts;
                        President-elect from November 1960

person.note:
Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Economic Affairs until February 1960;
                    thereafter Minister for Economic Affairs at the Embassy in the United
                    Kingdom
